WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.330
Tomosumi
Girls'
Middle
School

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.370
Senpai, you wanted to talk?

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.830
It was a long time ago, before I even met Touko...

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.410
Huh?

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.540
Sayaka-chan, um, listen...

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:16.950
I'm in love with you.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.830
At first, I thought it was weird.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.790
Girls dating other girls.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.870
But...

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:48.200
After Senpai entered high school,
we didn't see each other very often.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.750
Our time apart went on for days, stretching into weeks.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:58.410
But I believed that she was suffering from
the loneliness just as much as I was.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.160
Senpai!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.370
Oh...

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:07.870
Senpai?

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:13.450
Sayaka-chan, I'm sorry, but we're not kids anymore.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:18.450
I don't think it's good to keep pretending to date like this.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.330
We were just going through a phase.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.750
I mean, girls don't date other girls. Right?

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:34.370
You're the one who... made me think otherwise.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:37.910
I pushed it all to the back of my mind.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:44.120
I wanted so badly to make myself
believe that it really was just a phase.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:44.080
East Tomi High School
Entrance Ceremony

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.160
So that I could forget.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.330
Next, a speech from the freshman representative.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.790
First year, class three. Touko Nanami.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:52.750
Here.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:56.370
I had wanted to be chosen as
the representative for the ceremony,

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:01.540
but so much was on my mind that
I couldn't concentrate and my grades slipped.

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:01.450
Entrance Ceremony Pamphlet

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.830
Student Representative:   
Touko Nanami

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:07.620
I'll surpass her in no time.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:18.580
But...

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.250
...then I just stopped caring.

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:47.290
Morning rays shine through swaying branches

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:51.160
On this road lined with trees

00:02:51.540 --> 00:03:00.750
I can hear your familiar voice saying "Good morning"

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.450
Inside that locked glass box

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:12.500
I wonder what's been hidden

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:18.700
A tale that has begun

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:23.330
I want to know more about your world

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:29.450
I brushed against those fingers by chance

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:34.040
But now I'm holding on to them

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.500
Your strengths and weaknesses

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:44.040
I'll embrace all of them

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:50.120
Tightly

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.660
We're having a pop quiz this week!

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.080
What?

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.660
Is it just me, or is this class way too hard?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:06.290
I have to find some way to break
Nanami and Saeki's perfect streak.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.700
Then give the rest of us a break!

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.410
Keep it up, Sayaka. You'll beat Touko one of these days.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.700
Not happening.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.700
Don't you get frustrated always being number two?

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:20.200
Not at all. I'm simply no match for Touko.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.750
Come on, you know that's not true.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.120
It's a serious struggle just for me
to stay ahead of you, Sayaka.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.080
So, what is Nanami-senpai's personality really like?

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.410
Um...

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.000
Why exactly are you asking?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.080
This is my first time writing a script,
and I want to find a place to start.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:46.450
I thought if I knew more about the actors, then I
could craft the characters around them. You know?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.040
I see...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:49.790
What can you tell me?

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:54.410
Well, really... Nanami-senpai's reputation precedes her.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:05:00.250
Academically accomplished, well-mannered, liked
and trusted by everyone. Is that what you mean?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.080
That's right.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.450
She sounds like a walking cliché.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.830
I'm not sure what else to tell you.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:13.000
Characters who have some sort
of flaw are a lot easier to write.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:14.910
Does she not have any?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.910
Well...

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:22.660
The truth is that she has so many flaws
it's overwhelming, but I can't say that.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.790
If you can't think of any flaws, then maybe a quirk,
or some part of her that's oddly adorable?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.120
"Adorable", huh?

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:36.580
Is being shy and blushy something
you would consider adorable?

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:39.500
When exactly did you see her do that?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:45.080
Or maybe... the way she comes out
and says "love" so directly.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.620
No, no, I definitely can't say that.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.660
Is she really such a superwoman
that you can't think of anything?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.540
Huh? Oh, um, I guess.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:06:01.410
Although Senpai and I aren't actually dating each
other... I feel like we have way too many secrets.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:03.910
Koyomi! I need your help!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:04.870
What's wrong?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:09.410
Riko-sensei told me if I can't bring my grade up in
Japanese class, then I have to stay for extra lessons!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.080
You gotta do something!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:12.580
Japanese class?

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.580
What else do we do in that class besides listening to
her lectures?

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:19.290
Just tutor me! Despite her looks,
Riko-sensei is a total harpy!

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.950
That's "Hakozaki-sensei" to you.

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.250
But "Riko-sensei" is just so much easier to say!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.910
That may be true, but that doesn't
make it any less rude, okay?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.080
It's from Nanami-senpai.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.910
Okay, I promise to call you "Hakozaki-sensei",
so please spare me the extra lessons!

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.620
Koyomi, do you have some free time later?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.580
Huh? I do, but...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.700
Please! Hakozaki-sensei!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.910
She's asking if you have time after school to meet
with everyone in person.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.950
No can do.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.870
After school?

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:41.870
I'm begging you!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:46.080
That's fine, but... I'm nervous.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:48.660
I'm not sure I can actually write a good script.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:51.580
Don't worry, everyone's really nice.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:53.830
Touko.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.700
Oh, sorry. Wait a sec.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.540
To: Touko Nanami

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.580
Another addition to your love letter collection?

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:05.870
Who's it from this time? Yamauchi-kun perhaps?

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.910
Oh, I think Hosomi-kun gave you one recently, too?

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.370
How do you know all of that?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:21.080
Touko treats everyone like a friend, which does
give the impression that she's easy to approach.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:26.540
But in reality, she holds everyone at a certain distance
that prevents them from getting too close.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.120
Romance is out of the question.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.290
Is it from a girl?

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:33.450
Yeah.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:37.830
The last time this happened I made her cry,
so I need to let this one down gently.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.120
Do you not like girls?

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:47.370
That's not the problem, I just find it
difficult to turn them down.

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:50.000
I see.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.700
Koito-san, I have a favor to ask!
I'd like to meet and talk with

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:56.700
Kano-san in person, can you
ask her if she has any free time today?
If she's free, how about we set up
a meeting around 4 PM today?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.040
From Koito-san?

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.450
Yeah. We're on for this afternoon.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:08.500
She was so against the idea at first,
but now she's being oddly cooperative.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.040
She's the type who struggles
to turn people down when they ask for help.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.330
Because she's got a kind heart.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.000
You and Koito-san are becoming fast friends, it seems.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:21.870
I'm a little jealous...

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.580
Why is that?

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.660
What about that girl piqued
your interest so much, anyway?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:34.580
Well, among the first-years who joined
the Student Council, she was the only girl.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.620
Is it really so strange that I want to get along with her?

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:41.580
No...

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:51.160
Okay, I'm going to have a chat with them.
Will you wait for me?

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.500
Of course, go ahead.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.080
Touko will never belong to anyone.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.410
I just need you to stay like that.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:06.290
So long as you stay this way...

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.330
I can keep close by your side.

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:19.660
Sayaka is very kind, but in a different way than Yuu is.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.410
Sayaka never oversteps any boundaries.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:27.620
The only thing she ever asks of me,
is to stay as the version of me that's perfect.

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:35.540
As long as I keep playing that role,
she doesn't ask about what is hidden behind it.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.500
Just more secrets I have to keep...

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.830
I didn't realize this shop was here. It's very quaint.

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.290
Welcome.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.660
You were here a few days ago.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.700
I'm impressed you remembered us after just one visit.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.660
We don't get many high schoolers in here.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.200
And I always remember a pretty face.

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.910
Owner, check please.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.950
Be right with you.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.000
So, that's the owner of this shop.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.120
She looks so young I just assumed
she was an employee.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:20.040
Yeah.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.580
Now then, let's get back to you, Kano-san.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:25.620
Okay.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.870
Thank you for agreeing to write the script for us.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:30.620
Sure.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:36.620
The novel you let me read was very interesting,
so I'm really glad to have you onboard.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:42.660
I'm really only interested in practicing my writing skills,

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:48.450
and I think this will be a good opportunity
for me to collaborate with others.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.410
Thank you.

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:58.450
Welcome back. You got off work early today.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:00.200
Yeah, occasionally I do.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.580
Hakozaki-sensei?

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.200
Oh yeah, that's her.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.500
Good afternoon.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:09.290
Good afternoon. What are you girls all doing here?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:13.660
Just a Student Council meeting.
We're discussing our stage show for the culture festival.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.950
A "stage show", eh?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.370
Are you friends with the owner of this shop, Sensei?

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:21.450
She said "welcome back" to you.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:23.870
Ah, sort of...

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:29.580
Miya... uh, I mean, the owner and I
are old classmates from college.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:32.120
I visit this place every now and then,
so I'm just a familiar face.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:38.250
I can't boss you around once you leave school,
but just make sure you get back before it gets dark.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:39.370
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.290
So, you two know Hakozaki-sensei?

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:47.790
She's the Japanese teacher for our class.
Do you have her, too?

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:52.580
Not for class, but Hakozaki-sensei is
one of the advisors of the Student Council.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.790
Really? I didn't know that.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:58.500
Well, at our school the Student Council is mostly run
independently by the students themselves.

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:03.000
That explains why our homeroom teacher never comes to
meetings, even though he's also an advisor.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.660
Bye.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:10.700
Have a nice evening.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:16.660
Is something wrong?

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:17.540
Oh, nothing.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:24.290
It's just, Koyomi asked me earlier to explain what kind
of person you are and I wasn't sure how to answer.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:28.290
Well, that's... a tough question to answer.

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.750
I really struggled with it, you know.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:34.200
You must be good friends with Kano-san.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:40.790
I've known Koyomi since middle school and since
she likes books, she often visits my family's store.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.750
I only recently found out that
she started writing her own books, though.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.410
Yuu...

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.750
Is it okay if I also call you that?

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.370
I'm pretty sure you already have been.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:01.160
You know what I mean, I want to use your first name
during meetings and in front of everyone else.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:05.450
I think as my Senpai you're free
to call me whatever you want.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:07.290
Th-then...

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:10.950
Yuu.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.290
Yes?

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.200
That face...

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:20.120
...she looks so unphased by everything,
and when I see that face

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.950
it only makes me want to be a little more aggressive.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:29.540
I wonder how far I can push her?

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.660
Okay, then.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.660
Will you also call me by my first name?

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.250
Huh?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.500
Oh, sorry, if that's too-

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.830
Touko-senpai.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.370
Touko-senpai.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.870
Good grief, she's the one who asked me to say it.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.330
If that's going to be your reaction all the time,
then I can't do it in front of anyone else.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.000
I-I can play it cool!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:07.200
If you say so.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:10.080
Touko-senpai.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.000
Okay.

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.620
Touko-senpai.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.040
Yes.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.250
Touko... senpai.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.580
Quit it...

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:25.540
You have no problem pouring your affection on me,
but you're helpless whenever I start showing you any.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:32.040
I guess that's another part of her
that I could consider adorable?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.160
Though I can't mention this to Koyomi, either...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.500
Don't tease me, Yuu.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.120
I won't tell Senpai, either.

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.120
Riko, I'm done with the bath.

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:47.540
What are you looking for?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.750
An old stage show DVD.
I thought I would let those girls borrow it.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.370
So, you are going to help them.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:58.910
I thought you weren't,
since you didn't say anything to them earlier.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:02.040
Even though you used to be the advisor
for the Theater Club at your old school.

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:10.000
Because you let that "welcome back" slip,
I had to cut my conversation with them short, Miyako.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.040
Oh, that's my bad.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:17.620
It's easy for me to commute to school because
this place is so close, but we have to be careful.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.250
Are you going to make it to bed at a decent hour tonight?

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:22.790
Nope, I still have some work I need to take care of.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.410
Okay, then I'm going to bed.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:38.000
Secrets Galore

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.080
Good night.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.040
Sparks

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:48.620
Yuu, do you know where the roster
for the sports committee is?

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:51.370
Um, it should be in this file.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.540
Thanks.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:56.200
"Yuu"? Huh? Did she just use her first name?

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:01.330
Huh? Have you always called Koito-san
by her first name, Nanami-senpai?

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.000
Nice work, Dojima-kun!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.250
I thought we should start being
a little friendlier with one another.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.330
Well, my first name is "Suguru"!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.250
That's nice, Dojima-kun.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.830
Ouch, that's harsh.

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:18.750
I guess I'll also...
start calling Koito-san by her first name.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.580
Sure, feel free.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:32.160
No, I'll stick with "Koito-san".

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:36.950
I never used first names with younger students
in middle school, so it just doesn't feel right.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.000
Typical of a school for rich girls.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.950
That has nothing to do with it.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:45.370
Huh? Didn't the two of you attend
the same middle school together?

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.410
No, we didn't. We actually live pretty far apart.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:53.120
We first met after high school started.
Sayaka used to attend Tomosumi Girls' School.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:58.580
Huh? I thought that was a combined middle
and high school. Why did you transfer here?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:03.000
Because it's so much closer. I got tired of having
to commute to school by train every day.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:04.870
That doesn't seem like such a big deal.

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:19.290
I've never seen Touko let anyone
get that close to her before.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.160
They seem just like...

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:32.700
Regardless of how close Touko
and Koito-san have gotten recently,

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:37.000
it won't become any sort of genuine
or exclusive relationship.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.160
Touko will never belong to anyone.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.700
That's just how she is.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.200
Oh, hello there.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.660
May I have a seat at the counter?

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:06.580
Of course.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.910
On your own today?

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.370
Yes, a blend coffee please.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.790
Sure.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.450
Welcome back. You got off work early today.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.330
Yeah, occasionally I do.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.750
So, how's that stage show coming?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:31.700
Huh?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:34.580
You're doing one with the Student Council, right?

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.370
Sorry to keep you waiting,
do you want any sugar or milk?

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:39.450
No, thank you.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:45.910
Um...

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.000
May I ask you a question?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.290
Yeah?

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:56.080
This may seem somewhat rude of me, and I apologize
if I've gotten the wrong impression, but...

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.330
...are you currently in a relationship
with Hakozaki-sensei?

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.500
Yeah, that's right. She's my girlfriend.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:20.370
Oh, but please don't say anything to Riko.
She'll be upset I told.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:22.950
What's wrong?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:24.830
Nothing.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:28.450
You asked because you thought we were a couple, right?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.700
Well, yes. I'm sorry, I did have my suspicions...

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.200
...but I didn't expect to get such a frank answer.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:45.870
Well, back when I was your age, I also thought
I had to keep everything a secret.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.160
You must have one, too. A girl you like?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:54.120
Yes.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:20:02.950
I had convinced myself I would never fall for another girl,
which is why I chose to attend a coed school.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:07.700
But once I met her, I started to think otherwise.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.910
What do you like about her?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:10.750
Huh?

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.040
Um...

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:14.950
Her face?

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.160
Looks are important.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:23.000
Also, the fact that she's so accomplished.
She always stays one step ahead of me.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.910
And I love watching her work hard to achieve
all of the goals that she sets for herself.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.250
You really care for this girl.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.660
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to confide so much.

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:38.500
Maybe I just really needed to talk to someone.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:42.000
It's okay. I enjoy listening to the stories
my customers have to share.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:49.040
So, you're in a loving relationship. I'm really jealous.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:51.700
Why don't you try confessing?

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.250
That wouldn't work...

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:57.910
Is she not comfortable with girls?

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:03.950
I am worried about how she'll react in that respect,
but there's also another issue.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:05.540
Another issue?

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:11.200
She has no room in her heart to accept
the feelings of other people.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:16.830
Even if I confessed my feelings,
it would only become a source of stress for her.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:23.500
And if that ruins my current relationship with her,
then I'd prefer to just stay the course.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:29.540
Right now, she needs me to be there
as her best friend. That's enough for me.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:39.620
Is it wrong of me to hide my true feelings...
in order to stay by her side?

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:46.750
On the house, since you're so kind.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.540
"Kind"?

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:53.750
What that girl really wants right now
is for you to be her friend,

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:58.450
and you're putting aside your own feelings
to do that for her, right?

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.290
That's why I know you're very kind.

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:08.750
What if I'm... just afraid of being separated from her?

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:14.750
Regardless of the reason, keeping feelings like
that hidden causes a lot of stress.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.910
I want to know, but I also don't

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:21.870
I like things the way they are now (The way they are now)

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:20.370
So, take this. Okay?

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:25.450
If you must answer "Yes" or "No"

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.450
Thank you very much.

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:32.000
Then I hope tomorrow never ever comes

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:31.200
Ready, and...!

00:22:30.620 --> 00:22:31.410
ENGLISH POP QUIZ

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.290
I managed to stay on top again!

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.910
You seem pretty happy to be the loser, Sayaka.

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:39.870
That's not true at all.

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.450
The instant you slip up, that top spot will be mine.

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:43.580
Sure, sure.

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:52.160
That world was far away from me, or so I thought (Or so I thought)

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:47.870
Sayaka.

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:51.790
I'm glad you're a part of my life.

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:58.950
These feelings shouldn't apply to me (Shouldn't apply to me)

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:00.500
Without you, things would be easier...
easy enough that I think I would just slack off.

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:00.870
But for you, they could be possible

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:02.750
Showing what's actually inside my heart

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:05.700
I don't just mean academically,
but also being President and dealing with the council.

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.370
Because nothing will ever change it

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:08.250
I've figured out where my heart is

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:12.410
When I stand in front of you, I feel like it helps me
become the ideal person I strive for.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:10.080
It's about to become pretty uncomfortable

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:13.160
Now that the wind's flow has suddenly changed

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:15.790
What will tomorrow become?

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:18.000
So, I'll always rely on you, Sayaka.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.540
Soon it will bloom into you

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:21.160
Take a peek at how delicate I am inside

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:23.080
I've got butterflies in my stomach

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:24.910
If you found out about my feelings

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:30.370
The words I held back will just keep growing,
and one day they might rend my very heart in-two.

00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:28.700
I wonder if you'll run away?

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:34.660
But this is plenty for right now.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.830
I'm not ready for... things to change.
